    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2916980/extras/2eced402bb6e465e07691cb34aec9123.webp?t=1721679415\" width=622 height=60 /></span><br><strong>Sodden</strong> opens for you a dark thoughtful narrative of the game story of the survival horror genre. <br>Stylized 2D graphics emphasize only the silhouettes of the world around you. The elements of metroidvania will allow you to freely explore <strong>a closed science campus</strong>.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2916980/extras/storyhouse.gif ?t=1721679415\" width=622 height=60 /></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2916980/extras/b429553eb7f274548766a55a530aaa37.webp?t=1721679415\" width=622 height=60 /></span><br>You can survive in pairs thanks to the <u> local</u> cooperative. Build your tactics by working together.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2916980/extras/34a7e6e0833c4e99188800db05c3627f.webp?t=1721679415\" width=622 height=60 /></span><br>The complex architecture of the environment forces you to use the skills of <u>parkour</u>. You can avoid any collision with danger.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2916980/extras/667e8ff4e0e12de7f8a721ec8e20d414.webp?t=1721679415\" width=622 height=60 /></span><br>A large number of creepy creatures of different shapes and sizes will not leave you alone. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2916980/extras/1831a236a8e9768b653c9d07907d5dc9.poster.avif?t=1721679415\" width=614 height=154 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2916980/extras/1831a236a8e9768b653c9d07907d5dc9.webm?t=1721679415\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2916980/extras/1831a236a8e9768b653c9d07907d5dc9.mp4?t=1721679415\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2916980/extras/751cee3f8f9ef0809692b03e4383fb7f.webp?t=1721679415\" width=622 height=60 /></span><br>A wide range of weapons will allow you to survive for a long time.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2916980/extras/5a47ccac9f68441ce1fe1216cfcbc85c.webp?t=1721679415\" width=622 height=60 /></span><br>You can take a deep breath and plan your further actions in the scientific laboratory module. Cooking, water purification, item creation, safe sleep, charging a combat drone...<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2916980/extras/6e52efab993729b4035f8ca6d3a2260a.webp?t=1721679415\" width=622 height=60 /></span><br>Keep an eye on your health indicators: look for food and prepare it.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2916980/extras/3259cd13386c2a4b0c9eddad108fc20d.poster.avif?t=1721679415\" width=616 height=154 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2916980/extras/3259cd13386c2a4b0c9eddad108fc20d.webm?t=1721679415\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2916980/extras/3259cd13386c2a4b0c9eddad108fc20d.mp4?t=1721679415\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2916980/extras/416f80e37ab6776fa336dc6105735b1d.webp?t=1721679415\" width=622 height=60 /></span><br>Study the machine to create simple items or repair existing equipment.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2916980/extras/c47232125cd9b812b04f99d075583e98.webp?t=1721679415\" width=622 height=60 /></span><br>Look for the necessary materials on outings. Take as much as you can carry.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2916980/extras/9faa3a900cdfe7a954c5240c2412c9e2.poster.avif?t=1721679415\" width=616 height=154 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2916980/extras/9faa3a900cdfe7a954c5240c2412c9e2.webm?t=1721679415\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2916980/extras/9faa3a900cdfe7a954c5240c2412c9e2.mp4?t=1721679415\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
